message = "`stay(K, inst@Ord0, inst@Ord0@laws, b, vs, p, h)` is not structural: `stay` matches on its parameter `p`, so the argument for `p` is a part of the value matched here (a field, a field of a field matched in the arm, a function-typed field applied to all its arguments, or a part matched in the arm written as the arm's constructor), and `p` is not. Every argument of this call is the parameter's own, so the call does not get smaller; give it an argument that is a part of `p`"
span = "WStep(c, i, vs0, p0) => «stay(b, vs, p, h)»"
